":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls/23518","html_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/23518","diff_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/23518.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/23518.patch","merged_at":"2022-02-21T17:13:37Z"},"body":"Fixes #23338\r\nFixes #22808\r\n\r\nAdds logic to control GraalVM's `-H:IncludeLocales`.\r\n\r\n~If user sets anything but US English for any of~\r\n\r\n~quarkus.native.user-language~\r\n~quarkus.native.user-country~\r\n\r\n~or if user adds anything but US English to a new config option:~\r\n\r\n~quarkus.native.locales~\r\n\r\n~LoalesProcessor kicks in and augments native-image with necessary providers to enable translation~\r\n~of countries names, timezones and currencies.~\r\n\r\n~I intentionally didn't alter the option `quarkus.locales` that is used by Hibernate Validator.~\r\n~It is converted and used for a different purpose than native-image runtime locales availability.~\r\n\r\nSee https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/23518#issuecomment-1034382063","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/23518/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/23518/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":6110298413,"node_id":"REFE_lADOCFbutM5CygfWzwAAAAFsM8Et","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/events/6110298413","actor":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/following{